\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFollowing #43440, this PR adds unit tests for the `FontVariation` class.\r\n\r\nThere are two main test cases:\r\n\r\n1. Setting a value, then getting it, and comparing the result\r\n    - This isn't particularly valuable in isolation\r\n    - But provides a quick sense check for the latter tests\r\n2. Setting values, then comparing sizes against known (good) values for a:\r\n    - single character\r\n    - string\r\n    - multi-line string\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\n- There was a previous attempt at #99687, but this work is seemingly abandoned.\r\n- I added a variable font\r\n    - Namely [Inter](https://github.com/rsms/inter)\r\n    - This is open-source, and the license is included\r\n    - I subsetted to only include ASCII, reducing the size significantly","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":